OL,3,ATiger Woods to change plea after crash
OL,4,Aarrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded not guilty the same month to
OL,7,Fmisdemeanor charges of driving under
OL,8,Fthe influence and refusal to submit to
OL,9,Ftesting. Woods, 50, said he was seeking
OL,10,Ftreatment after the incident.
OL,12,FIt was not immediately clear what the
OL,13,Fchange of plea would be. The BBC has
OL,14,Fcontacted prosecutors and Woods'
OL,15,Fattorney.
